    "show_share": true,
    "description": "John-Allan Namu, a renowned Kenyan investigative journalist and a participant of the Executive Masters in Media Leadership and Innovation Programme (EMMLI) offered by the Aga Khan University Graduate School of Media and Communications (GSMC) was appointed to Reuter's Institute's Advisory Board. The board is made up of renowned journalists, media executives, and academics from around the world.",
